<title>USA: Northern Telecom syndicates US$1.1 bln.</title>
<headline>Northern Telecom syndicates US$1.1 bln.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern Telecom Inc said on Tuesday it is syndicating through a group of major financial institutions about $1.1 billion of its $1.3 billion vendor credit facility with Sprint Spectrum LP.</p>
<p>Sprint PCS, a partnership of Sprint Corp, Tele-Communications Inc, Cox Communications Inc and Comcast Corp, will market Sprint Spectrum's personal communication services, or PCS.</p>
<p>The syndication of participation rights and loan assignments is expected to be completed in early 1997, the company said.</p>
</text>
